{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "1stact_level_a001_06_beg",
  "groupId": "1stact",
  "stageId": "a001_06",
  "title": "黄金三角",
  "storyCode": "GT-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ef794dbe86d550016a04295794a2ea7e694e266e1384327f4bcf79a3e1b8d759",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "几年之前，我们成了感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们躲躲藏藏，平稳的生活一夜之间就变成了奢侈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原本，我们以为整合运动能使我们的生活有所改观，可......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "仍旧没有一家店肯卖给我们面包，没有任何地方能容纳我们落脚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我和兄弟们离开了那里，四处流浪，直到听说了宝藏的消息，来到了这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要这次，只要我们能夺下这份宝藏——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们就能前往哥伦比亚。虽然那是一片遥远的土地，但在那里，感染者还能拥有自己的城镇和田地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，格拉尼，为了我所有的兄弟，这份宝藏我一定会拿到手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "宝藏不远了，我知道。你做得很好，但是很遗憾————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "女人！你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别挡路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呜啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "我不管你们是什么人，要做什么事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "你们所有人，马上从我的视线里消失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果一定要和你为敌，斯卡蒂......今天我们会死战到底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "所以这种人就是格拉尼你找来的同伴？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "你们拿了宝藏，那滴水村怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不管怎么样，他们都还能活下去，我们却已经无路可走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然我认识你没多久，但我知道你是什么样的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你跟你身边那个怪物不一样，你没把我们感染者当成外人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "(我觉得斯卡蒂也只是一视同仁地把我们全都干掉而已，她大概也没把谁当成外人吧......)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "格拉尼，告诉我可萝尔在哪里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道这些宝藏对我们意味着什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "抱歉大鲍勃，我已经接下委托了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "我只有一个任务，就是把这份宝藏交给可萝尔，帮助她让村子恢复平静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "别的与我无关，把可萝尔交给我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你要那个女孩干什么，怪物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你难道想要剥掉她的皮，喝掉她的血吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在这之前，你也听这个小个子说过了，不管怎么样，她都不会把村长交给你的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我不一样，我只要宝藏。我根本不会伤害她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "我真的受够了......格拉尼，可萝尔在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "可萝尔只是想保护这个村子。她其实也不在乎宝藏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就把宝藏给我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "整合运动和赏金猎人也没什么不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我跟你们赏金猎人根本不是一路人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我曾经也是斯卡蒂你这样的混蛋，但现在我全都看清楚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "眼下这个世道，什么财富，地位，都是狗屁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们只想靠那笔宝藏活下去，仅此而已！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "我再说一遍，把可萝尔给我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "无论是可萝尔还是宝藏，我都不会交给你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "这可是我的委托。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "格拉尼！你还有机会！我不想和你打这场对谁都没好处的架！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只要拿到宝藏，谁都不会吃苦头！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "这份宝藏里本来就有你那一份，大鲍勃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我还有我的兄弟们！我要先见到宝藏再说！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "如果要用武力的话，我们之间的差距，你们自己心里明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "虽然没什么自信，但如果要同时和你们开战，我能做到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至少我们之间的问题是可以解决的，格拉尼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我们就先解决她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "说完了没？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "如果在这里开战，就真的没有回头路可走了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们————"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "格拉尼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太好了，我找到了！我找到宝藏了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我好不容易都把整箱都拖出———"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鲍勃先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你平安无事就——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "别过来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "......啧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈......哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们......早就没有回头路了!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "诶？可萝尔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "斯卡蒂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "你为什么要用这种没有威力的爆破物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还给她的人情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "接下来，就要用真的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "斯卡蒂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "你不关心宝藏。而且，你也不想伤害可萝尔小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "否则，在爆炸的那一瞬间，你就会出手掳走她并抢走宝藏，而不是保护她了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "我不要宝藏。我要的答案在可萝尔身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "早说出来不就好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "实话说，强装坏人也很累吧？坦率一点也好嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "我不想让其他人卷进我的......任务里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "但这次的任务目标对我而言，真的很重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "那当然，我知道。虽然我们任务不同，但方向是一致的不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "帮助其他干员完成任务，理所应当的吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#2",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "只能用武力来裁定宝藏的归属了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "斯卡蒂，下手一定要轻一点，轻一点哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "格 拉 尼！"
